      ],
      "text": [
        ":::{req} with_agent",
        "Criteria obtain the agent selected by the domain's validation cache through",
        "their `ValidationContext`. The application supplies the configuration under",
        "{cite}`requirements.sdk.validation-cache.with_agent`. The SDK does not persist it.",
        "A cache created without an agent supports deterministic criteria under",
        "{cite}`requirements.sdk.graph.criteria.deterministic_procedures`.",
        ":::"
      ]
    },
    {
      "requirements": "requirements.sdk.validation-cache.with_agent",
      "matches": [
        "requirements.sdk.validation-cache.with_agent"
      ],
      "text": [
        ":::{req} with_agent",
        "",
        "`ValidationCache::with_agent` accepts either a plain `AgentConfig` or an agent",
        "configured with tools under {cite}`requirements.sdk.graph.agent-harness.with_tool`.",
        "It creates an empty cache. Requests through the cache and its clones run that",
        "agent with its registered tools. The SDK defers backend setup until a criterion",
        "awaits an agent request.",
        "",
        "```rust,ignore",
        "impl<D: Domain> ValidationCache<D> {",
        "    pub fn with_agent(config: impl AgentSettings<D>) -> Self",
        "    where",
        "        D::NodeData: Serialize + DeserializeOwned + JsonSchema,",
        "        D::EdgeLabel: DeserializeOwned + JsonSchema + PartialEq,",
        "        D::Error: Display;",
        "}",
        "```",
        ":::"
      ]
